//! Built-in labelled tasks: `(title, effort, steps)`.
//!
//! * `effort` defines the scale (1 = a minute, no thought; 10 = days of work or a big life
//!   admin project). Used as kNN neighbours when the user has no similar history.
//! * `steps` is a short ADHD-friendly breakdown (the first step is trivially small) offered
//!   by `suggest_steps` for similar tasks. Tiny tasks have none.
//!
//! Embeddings of the titles are computed once per model and cached in the model directory
//! (see `tiny`). Editing titles changes the list hash, which invalidates the cache
//! automatically; editing efforts or steps needs no re-embedding.

pub(crate) type Anchor = (&'static str, u8, &'static [&'static str]);

